msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:97
#: 3a027c87f7504147a96af0e619d95f28
msgid "The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:99
#: 665bcfe2ffd14f1892307f38da6e71c3
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL5 (UART2) would need to be used for receiver connections. Below are setups using UART2. :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:101
#: acb2b5dbaeae4f239604a9669ef8f57b
msgid "FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to \"15\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:103
#: cef41f4ea67248b0bb1efbf13ea3b6af
msgid "CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:105
#: 801c4a2b65274fa58c60d73d16c1c746
msgid "SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" and connects only the UART2 TX pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:107
#: 820f9521abf641539633da08339be3b9
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

